  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Getting started",
      "text": "Talk to Chuck in the Ardougne Zoo",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Back to the Freezer Quest"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "questInterfaceOpen"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "[Accept Quest]",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [
        {
          "t": "questStarted"
        }
      ],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Note down the blue text.<ul><li>Alternatively, the Passphrase may also be found in your quest journal.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Rellekka marketplace, talk to Skot or Mundsen.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "When prompted, tell them the passphrase from Chuck.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Desert",
      "text": "After telling the passphrase, finish the dialogue and cutscene.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "South-west of Pollnivneach, talk to Dundee, who will give you a crocspeak amulet.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Ask about the penguins."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Equip the crocspeak amulet.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Just west, talk to Croc.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Bye"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "South-west, investigate the T.A.R.D.I.S..",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "The secret-secret agent",
      "text": "Return to Chuck in Ardougne.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Back to the Freezer Quest"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Note down the agent's favourite food Chuck tells you. Favourite food may be found in your quest journal.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to the T.A.R.D.I.S.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Unequip any item in your cape and weapon slot.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "With your clockwork suit in your backpack talk to any named penguin and you will automatically equip your clockwork suit.<ul><li>If you don't have a clockwork suit with you return to the zoo and speak with Chuck. Chuck will give you a clockwork suit.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In order, talk to the following penguins:<ul><li>Emperor Wing</li><li>Elon</li><li>Hugh</li><li>Gordon</li></ul>",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Remind me what happened."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What happened to you at the party?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What happened to you at the party?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What happened to you at the party?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What happened to you at the party?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Are you a spy?"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Gordon will give you a G.P.S.. If he does not, simply talk to him again.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Walk to the edge of the icy patch to get out of the clockwork suit.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "The secret bunker",
      "text": "Head to the pier north of Fremennik Province lodestone and north-east of Rellekka, travel to the Iceberg via the smaller boat.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [
        {
          "name": "Ice cooler",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        }
      ],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Locate with the G.P.S., follow the directions until you find the Mysterious Hatch.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To the north-east, right click Jim the polar bear and choose 'Tuxedo-Time'.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Interact with the hatch and type in '1234' to enter.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the north-east room and search the interactable cupboard on the north wall for a hat.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Exit the room and then follow the corridor south.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Head west and take the first turn north. Enter the large door leading to the large room in the centre of the bunker.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the locker room to your west and search Gordon's locker on the west side for the de-lore-ing device parts list and de-lore-ing device (incomplete).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Exit the large door to go back to the main corridor",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the southwest room full of crates and search or look in them until you find both a hammer and flax.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In the north-western room, Peruse the ice shelf (looks like a normal shelf) for The Penguin Book of Gielinor.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Behind you, Get Ice from the Ice Maker by the door to take ice cubes.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the hammer on the ice cubes to create the flax cap-ice-i-tor.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the flax cap-ice-i-tor on the de-lore-ing device (incomplete) for the de-lore-ing device.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Operate the de-lore-ing device.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Time travelling!",
      "text": "Take the monkey wrench (north & slightly east), use it on the de-lore-ing device then operate the device again.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Take the penguin bongos and cowbells in the north-west corner, use either on the device, operate the device again.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pick cabbage, use it on the device, operate the device again.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Speak to the man with a dragon pickaxe, use worthless old boots on the device, operate the device one last time.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Back in the bunker",
      "text": "Talk to Gordon in the south-western room.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Elon in the centre of the bunker.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Get the fishing rod from the corner of the War room south of the big door.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to the 'cold storage' crate room in the southwest and search until you have both the cog and coolant holder.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the cog on the fishing rod to create the 'fishvention' rod.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to the western room and gather Pure S-now - wait until you have gathered all 2,000. (Process takes about a minute)",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Search the crate north of the Mysterious Ice Block in the same room for a lemon.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the Mysterious ice block in the room to craft 2000 lemon sole runes.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to the north-western room and click on the Ice Maker twice to create cool-ant and an ice box.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to Buzz in the prison to the east for 21 killerwatt energy.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Leave the bunker via the door to the north.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Walk east, talk to Jim the polar bear to exit your disguise.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Yes"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Getting Energy",
      "text": "Equip your insulated boots and prepare for combat.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [
        {
          "name": "Insulated boots",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        }
      ],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Make your way to the top floor of Draynor Manor (staircase then ladder).",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Enter the eastern room, then the Interdimensional Rift.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Kill 10 Killerwatts until you have 121 killerwatt energy.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Returning to the iceberg",
      "text": "Return to the iceberg.<ul><li>Head to a pier north of Fremennik Province lodestone and north-east of Rellekka, travel to the Iceberg via the smaller boat.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [
        {
          "name": "Bright energy",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Flickering energy",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Gleaming energy",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Sparkling energy",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        }
      ],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Head to north-east of the iceberg, talk with Jim the polar bear, right click 'Tuxedo-Time'.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Re-enter the bunker via the Mysterious Hatch.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In the centre of the bunker, talk to Elon to give him all the items.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill the energy container to the north-west with your divination energy.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Configure the battery control station, north-west.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Solve the puzzle. See the full guide for advice on solving the puzzle.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Once complete, speak to the following penguins, in order:<ul><li>Elon, in the same (central) room, roaming around T.A.R.D.I.S.</li><li>Gordon, in the south-west room (northern part).</li><li>Hugh roaming around the north-west room.</li><li>Emperor Wing, in the central room again, easy to recognise due to his size.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Click the T.A.R.D.I.S. in the centre for a cutscene.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to Chuck.",
      "actions": [
        {
